{"5019920":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tasty Chef","steam_appid":5019920,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5201400],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, cook, and run your restaurant with your own two hands!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tasty Chef<\/i>, you are both the restaurant owner and a hands-on member of the team. Design work areas, purchase ingredients, manage storage, prepare dishes step by step, and serve customers before the orders pile up!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part of the restaurant is up to you. Expand your space, freely place cooking equipment, storage units, and workstations, improve your kitchen flow, and build a restaurant that runs efficiently.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Own Menu<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes, choose which dishes to serve each day, disable recipes you do not want to make, and customize flavors to create a menu that matches your restaurant’s style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item has its own unique preparation process. Prepare ingredients, use different equipment, complete every cooking step, and finally serve the finished food or drink to waiting customers.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Reliable Staff Team<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a restaurant does not mean doing everything yourself. You can hire NPC employees to help with all kinds of tasks the player can perform, including taking orders, preparing ingredients, cooking, serving, restocking, and organizing supplies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team that can keep the restaurant running on its own, so you can focus on growing the business. When the rush hour hits, you can always jump back into the kitchen and help out yourself.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Different Types of Restaurants<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The launch version includes the bubble tea shop and sushi restaurant. Start with a cozy bubble tea shop and unlock the sushi restaurant as you progress. Each restaurant features its own recipes, equipment, preparation processes, and management mechanics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned update: The bakery is not available in the launch version and is planned for an update in October 2026.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bubble tea shop focuses on drink preparation and flavor customization, while the sushi restaurant introduces completely different systems such as conveyor belt sushi. You will need to redesign your space and build a workflow that fits each restaurant’s unique style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no traditional fixed levels. Each restaurant is a business you can continue to expand, optimize, and personalize.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Restaurant Alone or With Friends<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the entire restaurant by yourself, rely on NPC employees for support, or play together with friends. Divide tasks, cooperate efficiently, and keep every area of the restaurant running smoothly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy hands-on cooking, planning efficient workflows, managing inventory, or training a reliable staff team, <i>Tasty Chef<\/i> lets you build your ideal restaurant in your own way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hands-on cooking gameplay with unique preparation steps<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely expandable and customizable restaurants<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Ingredient purchasing, storage, and restocking management<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable menus, recipes, and flavors<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NPC employees who can take orders, cook, serve, and restock<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple restaurant types with different mechanics and workflows<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Single-player and multiplayer support<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing, cozy atmosphere with bright colors and a 2.5D-style view in fully 3D environments<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, cook, and run your restaurant with your own two hands!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Tasty Chef<\/i>, you are both the restaurant owner and a hands-on member of the team. Design work areas, purchase ingredients, manage storage, prepare dishes step by step, and serve customers before the orders pile up!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part of the restaurant is up to you. Expand your space, freely place cooking equipment, storage units, and workstations, improve your kitchen flow, and build a restaurant that runs efficiently.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Own Menu<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes, choose which dishes to serve each day, disable recipes you do not want to make, and customize flavors to create a menu that matches your restaurant’s style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item has its own unique preparation process. Prepare ingredients, use different equipment, complete every cooking step, and finally serve the finished food or drink to waiting customers.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Reliable Staff Team<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a restaurant does not mean doing everything yourself. You can hire NPC employees to help with all kinds of tasks the player can perform, including taking orders, preparing ingredients, cooking, serving, restocking, and organizing supplies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team that can keep the restaurant running on its own, so you can focus on growing the business. When the rush hour hits, you can always jump back into the kitchen and help out yourself.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Different Types of Restaurants<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The launch version includes the bubble tea shop and sushi restaurant. Start with a cozy bubble tea shop and unlock the sushi restaurant as you progress. Each restaurant features its own recipes, equipment, preparation processes, and management mechanics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned update: The bakery is not available in the launch version and is planned for an update in October 2026.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bubble tea shop focuses on drink preparation and flavor customization, while the sushi restaurant introduces completely different systems such as conveyor belt sushi. You will need to redesign your space and build a workflow that fits each restaurant’s unique style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no traditional fixed levels. Each restaurant is a business you can continue to expand, optimize, and personalize.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Restaurant Alone or With Friends<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the entire restaurant by yourself, rely on NPC employees for support, or play together with friends. Divide tasks, cooperate efficiently, and keep every area of the restaurant running smoothly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy hands-on cooking, planning efficient workflows, managing inventory, or training a reliable staff team, <i>Tasty Chef<\/i> lets you build your ideal restaurant in your own way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hands-on cooking gameplay with unique preparation steps<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely expandable and customizable restaurants<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Ingredient purchasing, storage, and restocking management<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable menus, recipes, and flavors<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>NPC employees who can take orders, cook, serve, and restock<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple restaurant types with different mechanics and workflows<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Single-player and multiplayer support<\/strong><\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing, cozy atmosphere with bright colors and a 2.5D-style view in fully 3D environments<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Tasty Chef is a cozy restaurant management and cooking game where you build and expand unique restaurants, design menus, order ingredients, prepare dishes step by step, hire helpful staff, and serve customers alone or with friends.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/6b9a5aacc9303f8bac2255b7acef8780a568a1e5\/header.jpg?t=1790846854","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/f971e757c5698982345faba76800d370f2015314\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1790846854","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/f971e757c5698982345faba76800d370f2015314\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1790846854","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (version 21H1 or later) or Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5-9500T \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600H<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 660 \/ Radeon RX 460<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 6 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (version 21H1 or later) or Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-11700K @ 3.60GHz \/ AMD Ryzen 7 5700<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce RTX 2060 \/ Radeon RX 5700<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 12 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> both<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 6 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> both<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 12 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Xpercent Games"],"publishers":["Xpercent Games"],"demos":[{"appid":5067140,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1299,"final":1299,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$12.99"},"packages":[1740879],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Tasty Chef","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1740879,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Tasty Chef - $12.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1299}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":48,"description":"LAN Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/60376257fbbc09f1417b87bc47c3a61392750cee\/ss_60376257fbbc09f1417b87bc47c3a61392750cee.600x338.jpg?t=1790846854","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/60376257fbbc09f1417b87bc47c3a61392750cee\/ss_60376257fbbc09f1417b87bc47c3a61392750cee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790846854"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/cb3e795add1f1b05c2c28297f6ef0de11a547c63\/ss_cb3e795add1f1b05c2c28297f6ef0de11a547c63.600x338.jpg?t=1790846854","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/cb3e795add1f1b05c2c28297f6ef0de11a547c63\/ss_cb3e795add1f1b05c2c28297f6ef0de11a547c63.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790846854"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/cec8a881b6090890ac0bd368134d685b54c6ce39\/ss_cec8a881b6090890ac0bd368134d685b54c6ce39.600x338.jpg?t=1790846854","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/cec8a881b6090890ac0bd368134d685b54c6ce39\/ss_cec8a881b6090890ac0bd368134d685b54c6ce39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790846854"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019920\/c9ec6da